{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-206804-r4504850","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Cao lầu (Vietnamese Pork Noodles with Greens)","sourcePageId":206804,"sourceRevision":"4504850","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-10T01:04:28Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Cao%20l%E1%BA%A7u%20(Vietnamese%20Pork%20Noodles%20with%20Greens)&oldid=4504850","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:35:13.004Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Boiled recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using bean sprout","Category:Recipes using chile","Category:Recipes using croutons","Category:Recipes using lettuce","Category:Recipes using pasta and noodles","Category:Recipes using pork","Category:Recipes using sugar","Category:Recipes using vegetable oil","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Vietnamese recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"78784e5e8616ee9ac99b94ec9fd01bccd87b88cd3f543734bfda36c041eb27c4","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Noodle recipes\n| Servings = 3–4\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Vietnam|Cuisine of Vietnam]]\n\n'''Cao lầu''' is a Vietnamese regional noodle dish that originated in Hội An, in the Quang Nam Province of central Vietnam.\n\n==Ingredients==\n* 300 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] [[Cookbook:Pork|pork]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] (150 g) uncooked Hokkien-style [[Cookbook:Noodle|rice noodles]]\n* 2 cups (150 g) [[Cookbook:Bean Sprout|bean sprouts]]\n* 4 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] Chinese [[Cookbook:Five Spice Powder|five-spice powder]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Soy Sauce|soy sauce]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] [[Cookbook:Bouillon Cube|chicken stock powder]]\n* [[Cookbook:Turmeric|Turmeric]] powder (or [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]), for color\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Vegetable oil|vegetable oil]]\n* 1 cup (250 ml) water\n* [[Cookbook:Lettuce|Lettuce]]\n* Asian greens ([[Cookbook:Basil|basil]], [[Cookbook:Cilantro|cilantro]], etc.)\n* [[Cookbook:Chopping|Chopped]] fresh [[Cookbook:Chiles|chiles]] (for example Serrano chiles)\n* [[Cookbook:Crouton|Croûtons]]\n* [[Cookbook:Green Onion|Spring onions]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Heat oil and paprika in a [[Cookbook:Frying Pan|pan]].\n# Add pork, smashed garlic, soy sauce, chicken stock, and spices. [[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] for 3 minutes\n# Add 1 tbsp water and fry for a further 2 minutes.\n# Remove from heat, and set aside.\n# Bring a pot of water to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]]. Add sprouts, and cook for 1–2 minutes until soft.\n# Remove sprouts, add noodles, and cook noodles for 2 minutes.\n# Put noodles in a bowl on top of lettuce and greens. Add pork mixture, chopped spring onions, croûtons, and chiles.\n\n[[Category:Vietnamese recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pasta and noodles]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pork]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bean sprout]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using croutons]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lettuce]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Cao lầu (Vietnamese Pork Noodles with Greens)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"3–4","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"300 g pork","sourceText":"300 g pork","amountText":"300 g pork","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 cups (150 g) uncooked Hokkien-style rice noodles","sourceText":"2 cups (150 g) uncooked Hokkien-style rice noodles","amountText":"2 cups (150 g) uncooked Hokkien-style rice noodles","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 cups (150 g) bean sprouts","sourceText":"2 cups (150 g) bean sprouts","amountText":"2 cups (150 g) bean sprouts","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"4 cloves garlic","sourceText":"4 cloves garlic","amountText":"4 cloves garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","sourceText":"1 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","amountText":"1 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 tbsp soy sauce","sourceText":"1 tbsp soy sauce","amountText":"1 tbsp soy sauce","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 tsp sugar","sourceText":"1 tsp sugar","amountText":"1 tsp sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"1 pinch chicken stock powder","sourceText":"1 pinch chicken stock powder","amountText":"1 pinch chicken stock powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"Turmeric powder (or paprika), for color","sourceText":"Turmeric powder (or paprika), for color","amountText":"Turmeric powder (or paprika), for color","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"2 tbsp vegetable oil","sourceText":"2 tbsp vegetable oil","amo